 "remarks": "Set across three private acres in Westover, five-bedroom home is designed to harmoniously integrate refined interior living with its surrounding natural beauty. Expansive glass walls across the main living spaces frame uninterrupted water views, capturing soft southern light and opening effortlessly to a stone patio, pool deck, and serene pond. The residence balances elevated relaxation and effortless entertaining. The formal living/dining room feature hardwood floors and a stone fireplace, complemented by a spacious kitchen equipped with skylight and granite counters. The family room has Spanish tiles, and additional fireplace and sliders to the deck and pool. The main-level primary suite serves as a tranquil retreat with sweeping water vistas, dual baths, generous closets, and sauna. Two additional main-level bedrooms support seamless one-level living, while a wood-paneled office with custom built-ins and a home bar offers a dedicated space for work & hosting. Upstairs, two extra bedrooms and a flex room provide versatile accommodations. Outdoors, resort-style amenities blend into the landscape, featuring an in-ground pool, sunning deck, & a detached pool house complete with changing rooms, a full bath, kitchen facilities, a seating area overlooking the entire grounds. An expansive adjacent lot presents ideal space for personalized outdoor amenities. A generator & abundant storage complete this rare sanctuary of privacy and nature. House is being sold as-is.",
